    c = connect_db(Path(td) / "t.sqlite")
    assert isinstance(c, sqlite3.Connection)









def init_schema(
    conn:sqlite3.Connection
)-&gt;None:

Create or migrate schema.
Migration policy (simple, notebook-friendly): - version 0: create fresh schema - version 1: attempt to migrate scan_windows(node_id,…) -&gt; scan_windows(entity_type, entity_id,…) - then ensure wallet_actions exists

import tempfile


